# Scientific limits

This is a **2D / single-camera** smartphone video system, not laboratory motion capture.

Never claim: laboratory-grade 3D biomechanics; exact ground reaction forces; joint loading; internal tissue forces; medical or injury prediction.

Never invent biomechanical thresholds or scientific findings.

Every metric must document: definition, calculation method, bowling phase, scientific justification, and validation method.

If a video is unsuitable, **reject it**. Do not return an unreliable number.
